   "evidence": "`coeff_principalPart_zero` gives `(principalPart a \u03c6).coeff 0 = 0`. The module docstring itself limits the identification to `c_k` with `1 \u2264 k \u2264 N`, and `principalPart_eq_sum_of_coe_eq` does the same.",
